# The .venv is NOT committed (spec 02). Bootstrap creates it.
.venv/

# Python bytecode is deliberately NOT gitignored — it serves as
# the seeded/deterministic junk probe for the tt-python fixture
# (spec 02): a synthetic marker is planted at provisioning and must
# stay untracked + byte-identical. Interpreter-written in-tree caches
# (linux) are tolerated extra files. __pycache__/ is intentionally
# left untracked (not ignored).

